===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|chariot|lang=fro}}, from {{term|char||cart|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|carrus||waggon|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-chariot.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a two-wheeled, [[horse]]-[[drawn]] [[vehicle]], used in Bronze Age and Early Iron Age warfare
# a light four-wheeled [[carriage]] used for [[ceremonial]] or [[pleasure]] purposes

